RULES={"C–N bond formation":["Identify electrophilic carbon and nitrogen nucleophile.","Assess nucleophile activation.","Form the new C–N bond.","Account for leaving-group departure or catalytic turnover."],"Cross-coupling":["Identify electrophile and coupling partner.","Consider catalyst-mediated activation.","Form the new bond.","Regenerate catalyst where appropriate."],"Bond-order transformation":["Identify atoms whose bond order changes.","Determine reagent-driven electron flow.","Check proton, hydride, oxygen or halogen transfer."],"Bond cleavage/substitution":["Identify bond being cleaved.","Identify nucleophile/electrophile.","Evaluate substitution, elimination or deprotection."]}